  "message": "",
  "data": {
    "id": 6431,
    "type": 10,
    "mode": 0,
    "title": "Orange 20 Listening - Test 2 - Listening Passage 1",
    "status": "published",
    "time": 8,
    "quiz_code": "",
    "parts": [
      {
        "id": 6478,
        "quiz_id": 6380,
        "passage": 1,
        "title": "Listening Passage 1",
        "sort": 1,
        "content": "Listening Passage 1",
        "explanations": [],
        "questions": [],
        "vocabs": [
          {
            "id": 1720168,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720169,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: It’s really good to see you, Tom.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 87.74,
                  "from": 85.42,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720178,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Since I had to give up work, I feel I’m losing touch with my friends and colleagues.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 92.299995,
                  "from": 87.899994,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720193,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720194,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: We really miss you in the office.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 94.515,
                  "from": 92.675,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720203,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We were all so sorry you had to leave.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 97.075005,
                  "from": 94.915,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720213,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But you must be relieved to have more time to look after your mother.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 100.515,
                  "from": 97.475006,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720227,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "How is she?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 101.715004,
                  "from": 100.83501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720231,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720232,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Well, she’s very cheerful, but she needs a lot of help.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 105.475006,
                  "from": 101.875,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720243,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720244,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: Have you tried to get any support from the local council?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 109.020004,
                  "from": 105.98,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720257,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720258,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: No, I didn’t know I could.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 111.5,
                  "from": 109.1,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720265,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720266,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: Yes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.22,
                  "from": 111.58,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720269,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They offer different kinds of practical support.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 114.94,
                  "from": 112.380005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720277,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They realize that carers sometimes need time for all the other responsibilities they have, apart from the person they’re caring for, and also that they sometimes need a break.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 124.615005,
                  "from": 115.26,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720306,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720307,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Ah, absolutely.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 126.14,
                  "from": 124.78,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720310,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720311,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Okay, so tell me more.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 129.65501,
                  "from": 127.255005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720318,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "How do I go about getting this support?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 132.535,
                  "from": 130.05501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720327,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720328,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: Well, you’d have to have an assessment of your mother’s needs.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 135.655,
                  "from": 132.935,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720340,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "That means someone would come round and talk to you about the situation and what you need.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 140.42001,
                  "from": 136.1,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720358,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So for a start, they’d want to know the amount of time you spend looking after your mother every day.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 145.38,
                  "from": 140.74,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720378,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720379,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Okay.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 127.975,
                  "from": 127.255005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720382,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720383,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: Then they’ll probably ask you what sorts of tasks you do for your mother during the day.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 150.66,
                  "from": 146.5,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720402,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Things like if she needs help with getting dressed, for example.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 154.425,
                  "from": 151.225,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720414,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720415,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 155.225,
                  "from": 154.425,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720418,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I help her with that.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 156.82501,
                  "from": 155.225,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720424,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And also I help her get into the shower in the morning.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 160.105,
                  "from": 157.30501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720437,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720438,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: Yes, that’s sort of thing.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 161.70502,
                  "from": 160.105,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720444,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They’ll probably ask you if you do the shopping for her and help her at mealtimes, and whether she can cope using money.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 169.01001,
                  "from": 162.02501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720468,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720469,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Yes, that’s becoming a bit of a problem.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 172.13,
                  "from": 169.33,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720477,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "She used to be very good at it, but not anymore.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 175.73,
                  "from": 172.37,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720489,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720490,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: And be ready to tell them about anything you find particularly difficult about caring for your mother.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 227.70999,
                  "from": 222.51,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720509,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720510,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: So, recently, I’ve noticed she’s started to have quite bad problems with her memory.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 231.19499,
                  "from": 228.555,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720525,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "If I wasn’t there, I think she’d forget to eat, for example.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 238.795,
                  "from": 234.875,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720538,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And often she doesn’t seem quite sure what day it is.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 242.555,
                  "from": 239.435,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720550,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720551,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: Yes, tell them about that.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 244.77002,
                  "from": 243.01001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720558,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And are there any physical difficulties you have caring for her?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 248.69002,
                  "from": 245.17001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720570,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Lifting her, for example?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 250.53001,
                  "from": 248.93001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720575,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720576,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Yes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.22,
                  "from": 111.58,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720579,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "She’s quite heavy, and I’m afraid of hurting my back.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 255.89,
                  "from": 252.05,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720590,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’d be in real trouble if that happened.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 258.675,
                  "from": 256.435,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720599,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720600,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: They can give you advice about that and also about how to avoid the possibility of your mum having a fall.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 264.91498,
                  "from": 259.155,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720620,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720621,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Great.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 265.795,
                  "from": 264.91498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720624,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So once they’ve done this assessment, if I’m eligible, what happens next?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 272.59,
                  "from": 266.435,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720637,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720638,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: Well, they might support you financially.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 275.23,
                  "from": 272.91,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720646,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So they might help you with transport costs, like if you have to get a taxi to take your mother for an appointment, for example.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 282.11002,
                  "from": 275.63,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720671,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720672,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: I usually drive her myself actually.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 284.43,
                  "from": 282.27,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720680,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So could I claim for the petrol?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 287.775,
                  "from": 285.29498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720688,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720689,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: You could.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 288.57498,
                  "from": 287.775,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720693,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And you can claim for the insurance too.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 290.895,
                  "from": 288.895,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720702,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720703,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Oh, right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 292.095,
                  "from": 290.895,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720706,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720707,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: And if you need help with the housework, they can arrange for someone to come along once or twice a week.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 297.13498,
                  "from": 292.175,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720727,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And one other thing.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 299.23,
                  "from": 297.79,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720732,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I hope you don’t mind me saying this, but it’s important you look after yourself.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 303.47003,
                  "from": 299.55002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720748,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And it seems to me you’re under quite a bit of stress.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 306.19,
                  "from": 303.79,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720760,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720761,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: I am.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 307.15002,
                  "from": 306.19,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720764,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Yes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.22,
                  "from": 111.58,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720766,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720767,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tom: Well, tell the council, because they may be able to give you some advice on how to minimize it.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 312.91,
                  "from": 307.87003,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1720787,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1720788,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Woman: Really?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 314.42502,
                  "from": 313.465,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720790,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Though, actually, I feel so much better having talked to you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 320.02502,
                  "from": 315.385,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720802,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’ll get in touch with the council straight away.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 323.30502,
                  "from": 320.585,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1720808,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now, shall we go for coffee or something?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 326.105,
                  "from": 323.945,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "listen_from": 0,
        "listen_to": 410,
        "question_sets": [
          {
            "id": 692,
            "title": "Questions 1-10",
            "description": "Complete the table below. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.",
            "part_id": 6478,
            "question_type": "GAP_FILLING",
            "question_count": 10,
            "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Local councils can arrange practical support to help those caring for elderly people at home.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">This can give the carer:</p>\n<p>- time for other responsibilities</p>\n<p>+ a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_1\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Assessment of mother's needs</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">This may include discussion of:</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- how much <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_2\">______</span> the caring involves</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- what types of tasks are involved, e.g.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ help with dressing</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ helping her have a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_3\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ shopping</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ helping with meals</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ dealing with <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_4\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- any aspects of caring that are especially difficult, e.g.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ loss of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_5\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_6\">______</span> her</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ preventing a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_7\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Types of support that may be offered to carers</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- transport costs, e.g. cost of a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_8\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- car-related costs, e.g. fuel and <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_9\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- help with housework</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- help to reduce <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_10\">______</span></p>",
